---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="關於｜盧鼎頤" description="盧鼎頤，畢業於大安高工資訊科，目前就讀於台灣科技大學電子工程系。">
  <section class="page-masthead">
    <div class="page-masthead__inner shell"><h1 class="page-title">關於</h1></div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-page shell">
    <div class="intro">
      <figure class="about-visual">
        <img class="about-art" src="/images/editorial-arches.webp" alt="" width="1536" height="1024" aria-hidden="true" />
        <img class="about-portrait" src="/images/profile-placeholder.svg" alt="盧鼎頤的大頭照預留位置" />
        <figcaption>照片預留</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="intro-copy">
        <p>我是盧鼎頤，畢業於大安高工資訊科，目前就讀於台灣科技大學電子工程系。</p>
        <p class="purpose">這個部落格用來展示與記錄成果，也整理製作過程中的方法、問題和想法。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="details">
      <h2>學習經歷</h2>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>目前</dt><dd>國立台灣科技大學<br />電子工程系</dd></div>
        <div><dt>畢業</dt><dd>臺北市立大安高級工業職業學校<br />資訊科</dd></div>
        <div><dt>聯絡</dt><dd><a href="mailto:dennylulu1215@gmail.com">dennylulu1215@gmail.com</a></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .about-page { padding-block: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px) clamp(110px, 14vw, 190px); }
  .intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 1.05fr) minmax(0, .95fr); gap: clamp(64px, 10vw, 150px); align-items: center; padding-bottom: clamp(90px, 12vw, 160px); }
  .about-visual { position: relative; margin: 0 48px 48px 0; }
  .about-art { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3 / 2; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 20px; object-fit: cover; }
  .about-portrait { position: absolute; right: -48px; bottom: -48px; width: clamp(160px, 18vw, 240px); aspect-ratio: 1; border: 10px solid rgba(238, 236, 231, .82); border-radius: 50%; background: var(--paper-deep); box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(18, 20, 28, .18); object-fit: cover; backdrop-filter: blur(16px); }
  figcaption { position: absolute; right: -40px; bottom: -70px; color: var(--muted); font: 500 .68rem var(--font-body); }
  .intro-copy > p:first-child { max-width: 760px; margin: 0; font: 500 clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.6rem)/1.65 var(--font-display); letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  .purpose { max-width: 42ch; margin: 30px 0 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.9; }
  .details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; gap: clamp(40px, 8vw, 130px); border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: 40px; }
  h2 { margin: 0; color: var(--blue); font: 600 1.4rem var(--font-display); }
  dl { margin: 0; } dl div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-light); padding: 20px 0; }
  dl div:first-child { border-top: 0; } dt { color: var(--blue); font: 500 .68rem var(--font-ui); } dd { margin: 0; line-height: 1.8; }
  dd a { color: var(--blue); text-underline-offset: .25em; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .intro, .details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .about-visual { width: calc(100% - 28px); margin-right: 28px; } .about-portrait { right: -28px; bottom: -54px; width: 150px; border-width: 7px; } figcaption { right: -20px; bottom: -74px; } .intro-copy { margin-top: 34px; } }
</style>
